  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NMS-Tamar Campaign Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall development goal is to see NMS partner churches capacitated and equipped to speak against and address violence against women. Its aims are to encourage churches to openly speak out against abuse and violence against women, and to create awareness of the link between gender based violence and HIV/AIDS. The project which is led by NMS uses the Tamar Campaign methodology to teach trainers and coordinators in the NMS partner churches in Ethiopia, Madagascar, Cameroon.</narrative>
  </description>
